<title>USA: TV Filme Inc sells $140 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>TV Filme Inc sells $140 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt offering from TV Filme Inc, a Brazilian wireless cable company, was priced on Monday, according to market sources. The deal was increased in size to $140 million from $125 million. Bear Stearns &amp; Co Inc acted as lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER TV FILME INC</p>
<p>AMT $140 MLN	 COUPON 12 7/8 PCT MATURITY  12/15/04</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 6/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 12 7/8 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 656 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR</p>
<p>							    FOUR YEARS</p>
<p>NOTE: A PORTION OF THE PROCEEDS WILL BE USED TO PREFUND TWO-YEARS OF INTEREST PAYMENTS</p>
<p>	  U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
</text>
